0..76 Comment "// A Tarski universe written by hand: a datatype of codes and a decoder from"
77..152 Comment "// codes to value types. The decode of a code over a binder is a value type"
153..229 Comment "// over a neutral code, compared by its code; the decode of a code that runs"
230..307 Comment "// to a quote is the quoted type. The arrow code decodes to the function type"
308..385 Comment "// between its two decoded sides, so a function at a decoded arrow applies. A"
386..452 Comment "// type a body quotes reads each binder where the body binds it. A"
453..527 Comment "// constructor field may read the one before it, so a value packs with its"
528..536 Comment "// code."
